msgstr "Slob"

#: rooms/boss_arena.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Длинный дом ярла"
msgstr "The Jarl's Longhouse"

#: rooms/room.gd:19
msgid "Зал"
msgstr "Hall"

#: rooms/room_01.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Зал бочек"
msgstr "Barrel Hall"

#: rooms/room_02.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Ярусы Ётунов"
msgstr "Jotun Tiers"

#: rooms/room_03.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Кольцо колонн"
msgstr "Ring of Pillars"

#: rooms/room_04.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Коридор Хель"
msgstr "Hel's Corridor"

#: rooms/room_05.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Мост Биврёст (сломан)"
msgstr "Bifrost Bridge (broken)"

#: rooms/room_06.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Склад медовухи"
msgstr "Mead Storehouse"

#: rooms/room_07.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Причал с драккаром"
msgstr "Longship Pier"

#: rooms/room_08.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Яма-колизей"
msgstr "Colosseum Pit"

#: rooms/room_09.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Деревня у фьорда"
msgstr "Fjord Village"

#: rooms/shop_stall.gd:34
msgid "[E] Ларёк Брокка и Эйтри"
msgstr "[E] Brokk & Eitri's Stall"

#: rooms/sven_arena.tscn (room_title)
msgid "Пивной погреб Свена"
msgstr "Sven's Beer Cellar"

#: run/bodies/berserker.tres (description)
msgid "Много здоровья, бьёт тяжело, бегает медленно. Орёт."
msgstr "Lots of health, hits hard, runs slow. Yells."

#: run/bodies/berserker.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Орёт, потеет, бьёт. Почти как ты в молодости. Почти."
msgstr "Yells, sweats, hits. Almost like you in your youth. Almost."

#: run/bodies/courier.tres (description)
#: run/bodies/courier.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Быстрее всех убегает. Иногда — в правильную сторону."
msgstr "Runs away faster than anyone. Sometimes in the right direction."

#: run/bodies/courier.tres (display_name)
msgid "Трусливый гонец"
msgstr "Timid Courier"

#: run/bodies/hunter.tres (description)
msgid "Быстрый и хрупкий. Три руны Мьёльнира."
msgstr "Fast and fragile. Three Mjolnir runes."

#: run/bodies/hunter.tres (display_name)
msgid "Охотник"
msgstr "Hunter"

#: run/bodies/hunter.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Быстрый, тощий, стреляет из-за угла. Не привыкай."
msgstr "Fast, skinny, shoots from around corners. Don't get used to it."

#: run/bodies/priest.tres (description)
#: run/bodies/priest.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Старше меня. Ну, почти. Руны слушаются его вдвое лучше."
msgstr "Older than me. Well, almost. Runes obey him twice as well."

#: run/bodies/priest.tres (display_name)
msgid "Старый жрец"
msgstr "Old Priest"

#: run/bodies/shieldmaiden.tres (description)
#: run/bodies/shieldmaiden.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Парирует лучше, чем ты споришь. Стрелять не любит."
msgstr "Parries better than you argue. Doesn't like shooting."

#: run/bodies/shieldmaiden.tres (display_name)
msgid "Дева щита"
msgstr "Shieldmaiden"

#: run/bodies/skald.tres (description)
#: run/bodies/skald.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Поёт, падает, встаёт. Первый удар в зале его даже не будит."
msgstr "Sings, falls, gets up. The first hit in a room doesn't even wake him."

#: run/bodies/skald.tres (display_name)
msgid "Пьяный скальд"
msgstr "Drunk Skald"

#: run/bodies/smith.tres (description)
#: run/bodies/smith.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Руки как наковальни. Рывок в воздухе? Он и на земле еле прыгает."
msgstr "Hands like anvils. Air dash? He can barely jump on the ground."

#: run/bodies/smith.tres (display_name)
msgid "Кузнец"
msgstr "Smith"

#: run/bodies/soldier.tres (description)
#: run/bodies/soldier.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Палка-стрелялка и железная каска. Я его презираю. Но он хорош."
msgstr "Boom-stick and an iron helmet. I despise him. But he's good."

#: run/bodies/soldier.tres (display_name)
msgid "Солдат"
msgstr "Soldier"

#: run/bodies/thrall.tres (description)
msgid "Всё слабое, но Слава ×2. Социальный лифт."
msgstr "Everything's weak, but Glory ×2. Social mobility."

#: run/bodies/thrall.tres (display_name)
msgid "Батрак"
msgstr "Farmhand"

#: run/bodies/thrall.tres (odin_comment)
msgid "Метла, лапти и мечты. Слава ему идёт вдвое — социальный лифт."
msgstr "A broom, bast shoes and dreams. Glory suits him double — social mobility."

#: run/body_def.gd:7
msgid "Берсерк"
msgstr "Berserker"

#: run/movement/base.tres (description)
msgid "Два рывка, двойной прыжок, удар-приземление — как учили."
msgstr "Two dashes, double jump, ground slam — by the book."

#: run/movement/heavy.tres (description)
msgid "Нет двойного прыжка. Удар-приземление ×1.5 по радиусу и урону, стан 1 с, отскок выше."
msgstr "No double jump. Ground slam ×1.5 radius and damage, 1 s stun, higher bounce."

#: run/movement/heavy.tres (title)
msgid "Тяжёлый"
msgstr "Heavy"

#: run/movement/jumper.tres (description)
msgid "Тройной прыжок, отскок от стены 3 раза и сильнее. Рывок — только в воздухе."
msgstr "Triple jump, wall bounce 3 times and stronger. Dash — only in the air."

#: run/movement/jumper.tres (title)
msgid "Прыгун"
msgstr "Jumper"

#: run/movement/nimble.tres (description)
msgid "Короткие рывки. Базовое восстановление руны: %s с на земле."
msgstr "Short dashes. Base rune recharge: %s s on the ground."

#: run/movement/nimble.tres (title)
msgid "Шустрый"
msgstr "Nimble"

#: run/movement/nimble_plus.tres (description)
msgid "Быстрые рывки. Базовое восстановление руны: %s с на земле — быстрее всех."
msgstr "Fast dashes. Base rune recharge: %s s on the ground — the fastest."

#: run/movement/nimble_plus.tres (title)
msgid "Шустрый+"
msgstr "Nimble+"

#: run/movement/ram.tres (description)
msgid "Длинный рывок сквозь врагов (0.7 У): отбрасывает и раскидывает бочки. Руна: %s с на земле (базово)."
msgstr "Long dash through enemies (0.7 dmg): knocks back and scatters barrels. Rune: %s s on the ground (base)."

#: run/movement/ram.tres (title)
msgid "Таран"
msgstr "Battering Ram"

#: run/movement/slider.tres (description)
msgid "Рывок по земле переходит в подкат, скорость не гасится (до ×2.2 от бега). Прыгай из подката."
msgstr "A ground dash turns into a slide, speed is kept (up to ×2.2 of running). Jump out of the slide."

#: run/movement/slider.tres (title)
msgid "Скользящий"
msgstr "Slider"

#: run/passives/backstab_x2.tres (description)
msgid "×2 урона в спину"
msgstr "×2 damage from behind"

#: run/passives/backstab_x2.tres (title)
msgid "Удар в спину"
msgstr "Backstab"

#: run/passives/berserker_flaw.tres (description)
msgid "Лечение −50%, враги замечают издалека"
msgstr "Healing −50%, enemies notice you from afar"

#: run/passives/berserker_flaw.tres (title)
msgid "Орёт и плохо лечится"
msgstr "Yells and heals poorly"

#: run/passives/berserker_flaw.tres (todo)
msgid "«Орёт» — пока только звук: враги и так всегда видят Тора"
msgstr "“Yells” is just a sound for now: enemies always see Thor anyway"

#: run/passives/blood_rage.tres (description)
msgid "+1% урона за каждый 1% потерянного HP (до +50%)"
msgstr "+1% damage for every 1% of HP lost (up to +50%)"

#: run/passives/blood_rage.tres (title)
msgid "Кровавая ярость"
msgstr "Blood Rage"

#: run/passives/coward_front.tres (description)
msgid "Урон спереди −30%"
msgstr "Damage from the front −30%"

#: run/passives/coward_front.tres (title)
msgid "Трус"
msgstr "Coward"

#: run/passives/dash_reload.tres (description)
msgid "Рывок мгновенно перезаряжает ренж"
msgstr "A dash instantly reloads your ranged weapon"

#: run/passives/dash_reload.tres (title)
msgid "Тактическая перезарядка"
msgstr "Tactical Reload"

#: run/passives/first_hit_free.tres (description)
msgid "Первый полученный удар в каждом зале не ранит"
msgstr "The first hit taken in each room doesn't hurt"

#: run/passives/first_hit_free.tres (title)
msgid "Пьяному море по колено"
msgstr "Drunk and Fearless"

#: run/passives/frail.tres (description)
msgid "Хрупкое тело — держи дистанцию"
msgstr "Fragile body — keep your distance"

#: run/passives/frail.tres (title)
msgid "Мало HP"
msgstr "Low HP"

#: run/passives/no_air_dash.tres (description)
msgid "Нет рывка в воздухе"
msgstr "No air dash"

#: run/passives/no_air_dash.tres (title)
msgid "Тяжёлые сапоги"
msgstr "Heavy Boots"

#: run/passives/odin_scorn.tres (description)
msgid "Слава −30%"
msgstr "Glory −30%"

#: run/passives/odin_scorn.tres (title)
msgid "Один его презирает"
msgstr "Odin Despises Him"

#: run/passives/old_slow.tres (description)
msgid "Медленный, кряхтит при прыжке"
msgstr "Slow, groans when jumping"

#: run/passives/old_slow.tres (title)
msgid "Кряхтит"
msgstr "Groaner"

#: run/passives/parry_master.tres (description)
msgid "Окно парирования ×2, парирование лечит 5 HP"
msgstr "Parry window ×2, parrying heals 5 HP"

#: run/passives/parry_master.tres (title)
msgid "Мастер щита"
msgstr "Shield Master"

#: run/passives/parry_master.tres (todo)
msgid "Парирования мечом ещё нет"
msgstr "Sword parrying isn't in yet"

#: run/passives/ranged_no_slow.tres (description)
msgid "Ренж в руке не замедляет"
msgstr "Ranged weapon in hand doesn't slow you"

#: run/passives/ranged_no_slow.tres (title)
msgid "Привычка к луку"
msgstr "Used to the Bow"

#: run/passives/ranged_weak.tres (description)
msgid "Ренж наносит −25%"
msgstr "Ranged deals −25%"

#: run/passives/ranged_weak.tres (title)
msgid "Не её оружие"
msgstr "Not Her Weapon"

#: run/passives/runes_x2.tres (description)
msgid "Все руны действуют ×2"
msgstr "All runes work ×2"

#: run/passives/runes_x2.tres (title)
msgid "Мудрость предков"
msgstr "Wisdom of the Ancestors"

#: run/passives/smith_level.tres (description)
msgid "Оружие сразу +1 уровень, заточка у Эйтри −50%"
msgstr "Weapon starts +1 level, sharpening at Eitri's −50%"

#: run/passives/smith_level.tres (title)
msgid "Своя наковальня"
msgstr "His Own Anvil"

#: run/passives/smith_level.tres (todo)
msgid "Заточка у Эйтри — когда появится ларёк"
msgstr "Sharpening at Eitri's — once the stall exists"

#: run/passives/social_lift.tres (description)
msgid "Слава ×2"
msgstr "Glory ×2"

#: run/passives/social_lift.tres (title)
msgid "Социальный лифт"
msgstr "Social Mobility"

#: run/passives/weak.tres (description)
msgid "Урон −30%"
msgstr "Damage −30%"

#: run/passives/weak.tres (title)
msgid "Слабак"
msgstr "Weakling"

#: run/passives/wobbly_aim.tres (description)
msgid "Прицел покачивается"
msgstr "Your aim sways"

#: run/passives/wobbly_aim.tres (title)
msgid "Пьяный прицел"
msgstr "Drunk Aim"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:156
msgid "НАКОВАЛЬНЯ ЭЙТРИ — СТИХИЯ МОЛОТА"
msgstr "EITRI'S ANVIL — THE HAMMER'S ELEMENT"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:176
msgid "БЛАГОСЛОВЕНИЕ ФРЕЙИ — РУНА СРАЗУ УР. %d"
msgstr "FREYA'S BLESSING — RUNE STARTS AT LV. %d"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:179
msgid "РУНА ИСПЫТАНИЯ — СРАЗУ НА УРОВЕНЬ ВЫШЕ"
msgstr "TRIAL RUNE — ONE LEVEL HIGHER RIGHT AWAY"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:187
#: run/reward_flow.gd:201
#: run/reward_flow.gd:203
msgid "%s %s — уровень %d"
msgstr "%s %s — level %d"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:190
msgid "Руна «%s». Почти не проклятая."
msgstr "Rune “%s”. Barely cursed."

#: run/reward_flow.gd:197
msgid "ᛒ %s — уровень %d"
msgstr "ᛒ %s — level %d"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:225
msgid "ЭЛИТА ПОВЕРЖЕНА: ОРУЖИЕ + СЛАВА"
msgstr "ELITE DOWN: WEAPON + GLORY"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:241
msgid "ИСПЫТАНИЕ ПРОВАЛЕНО — БЕЗ НАГРАДЫ"
msgstr "TRIAL FAILED — NO REWARD"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:245
msgid "ИСПЫТАНИЕ ПРОЙДЕНО!"
msgstr "TRIAL PASSED!"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:249
msgid "ИСПЫТАНИЕ ПРОЙДЕНО: +%d СЛАВЫ"
msgstr "TRIAL PASSED: +%d GLORY"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:271
msgid "Один разрешил пять минут. Выбери одно."
msgstr "Odin allowed five minutes. Pick one."

#: run/reward_flow.gd:271
msgid "ПРИВАЛ"
msgstr "REST STOP"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:272
msgid "Лечение %d %% (+%d HP)"
msgstr "Heals %d %% (+%d HP)"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:272
msgid "Похлёбка"
msgstr "Stew"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:273
msgid "Нет рун для улучшения"
msgstr "No runes to upgrade"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:273
msgid "Точить руну"
msgstr "Sharpen a Rune"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:273
msgid "Улучшить руну на 1 уровень"
msgstr "Upgrade a rune by 1 level"

#: run/reward_flow.gd:288
